\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Come\cf0  children, come ye all and see and behold
\par \pard\li144   In Bethlehem in a stable full of sheep
\par   What joyous thing our heav'nly father has done
\par  for us in this holy, in this holy night.
\par 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  A new born baby is wrapped in swaddling clothes
\par     Lying in a manger with Mother Mary \tab 
\par \pard\li144\qj   From the highest heaven he came all from God
\par   The first born son of God in highest heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. See how innocently he laid 
\par     on the hay
\par \pard\li144\qj   Mary and Joseph were all at his service
\par \pard\li144\cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par \pard\li144\qj Angels from heav'n came to 
\par   praise his mighty name
\par   Whiles shepherds of the field 
\par   thronged to worship Him
\par 
\par \pard\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Come you too and worship him, He is your Lord
\par \pard\li144\sl202\slmult0\qj  Be very grateful to him, He is your friend
\par   He left all his glory in heav'n and came down
\par \pard   and to save us all because of his great love.  \i\tab\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

